  tests/hybrid/v_drain_policy.test.cpp

feat "feat(gdbstub): GDB RSP client/session for QEMU2 handback" \
"RSP packet encode/decode for the QEMU2 gdbstub handback path.

/simplify: scalar encode_p_body now serializes to a byte array and delegates
